<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-direct-path> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Satipatthana: The Direct Path to Realization"@en ;
  dct:type "Book"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.buddhismuskunde.uni-hamburg.de/pdf/5-personen/analayo/direct-path.pdf> ;
  rdfs:comment "Bhikkhu Anālayo’s commentary, offered as a free PDF by the University of Hamburg. The book remains his copyright, so its prose is not copied here. The terms below are the public-domain satipaṭṭhāna map the book explains."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-practice-guide> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Early Buddhist Satipaṭṭhāna Meditation: A Practice Guide"@en ;
  dct:type "Book"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.buddhismuskunde.uni-hamburg.de/pdf/5-personen/analayo/satipatthanapracticeguide.pdf> ;
  rdfs:comment "Anālayo’s practice companion to the same four foundations, also a free PDF from Hamburg, and also not copied into these glosses."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-compassion> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Compassion and Emptiness in Early Buddhist Meditation"@en ;
  dct:type "Book"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.buddhismuskunde.uni-hamburg.de/pdf/5-personen/analayo/compassionemptiness.pdf> ;
  rdfs:comment "Anālayo on karuṇā and suññatā in the early texts. The PDF is free to read; the glossary keeps its own short glosses."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-varela-science-religion-art> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Francisco Varela on Science, Religion and Art"@en ;
  dct:type "Talk"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vgZMPcrRmio> ;
  rdfs:comment "A contemporary talk, not a Pāli text. It sits beside the body and mindfulness, where practice meets embodied cognition."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-salzberg-openness> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Sharon Salzberg: The Journey from Isolation to Openness"@en ;
  dct:type "Talk"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wu9A1YHLU5Q&t=298> ;
  rdfs:comment "A talk on goodwill and opening the heart. The Pāli term it bears on is mettā."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-traditions> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Bhikkhu Anālayo: Respecting Different Buddhist Traditions"@en ;
  dct:type "Talk"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cd8zAVltf4s> ;
  rdfs:comment "A conversation about staying with the early teaching while respecting other Buddhist traditions."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-lions-roar-sati> a dct:BibliographicResource ;
  dct:title "Lion's Roar: Meet Sati-AI"@en ;
  dct:type "Article"@en ;
  rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.lionsroar.com/ai-meditation-teacher/> ;
  rdfs:comment "A magazine piece about this project. It is an article, not a canonical source, and it points back to sati."@en .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tilakkhana> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-three-marks> ;
  skos:prefLabel "tilakkhaṇa"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "three marks"@en ;
  skos:definition "The three characteristics of conditioned experience: impermanence, unsatisfactoriness, and not-self. Seeing them clearly is the heart of insight."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "three marks"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "three characteristics"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#anicca> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#dukkha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#anatta> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#anicca> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-three-marks> ;
  skos:prefLabel "anicca"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "impermanence"@en ;
  skos:definition "Whatever arises changes and ceases. Nothing conditioned stays fixed."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "impermanence"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "impermanent"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tilakkhana> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#dukkha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#anatta> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#dukkha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-three-marks> ;
  skos:prefLabel "dukkha"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "unsatisfactoriness"@en ;
  skos:definition "The strain of experience that cannot finally satisfy: pain, change, and the burden of conditioned life. It is the first noble truth, not a claim that every moment feels miserable."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "suffering"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "unsatisfactoriness"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "stress"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tilakkhana> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#ariyasacca> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> ;
  dct:source <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-compassion> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#anatta> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-three-marks> ;
  skos:prefLabel "anattā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "not-self"@en ;
  skos:definition "No experience, body, or mind contains a permanent owner. What is seen as 'me' or 'mine' is a changing process."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "not-self"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "non-self"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "no self"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tilakkhana> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#pancakkhandha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sunnata> ;
  dct:source <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#source-analayo-compassion> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#ariyasacca> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "cattāri ariyasaccāni"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "four noble truths"@en ;
  skos:definition "The framework of the teaching: unsatisfactoriness, its origin, its cessation, and the path to cessation. Each truth has a task: understand, abandon, realize, develop."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "four noble truths"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "noble truths"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#dukkha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#samudaya> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#nirodha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#magga> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#samudaya> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "dukkhasamudaya"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "origin of unsatisfactoriness"@en ;
  skos:definition "The second truth. Craving produces the repeating stress of conditioned life."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "origin"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#ariyasacca> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#nirodha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "dukkhanirodha"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "cessation"@en ;
  skos:definition "The third truth. Unsatisfactoriness ends when craving ends. That end is nibbāna."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "cessation"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#nibbana> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#ariyasacca> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#magga> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "magga"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "path"@en ;
  skos:definition "The fourth truth: the way of practice that leads to cessation, spelled out as the noble eightfold path."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "the path"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "eightfold path"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#atthangikamagga> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#ariyasacca> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "taṇhā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "craving"@en ;
  skos:definition "Thirst for sense pleasure, for becoming, or for getting rid of what is painful. It is named as the origin in the second truth."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "thirst"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#samudaya> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#upadana> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#kamatanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#bhavatanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#vibhavatanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#nirodha> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#kamatanha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "kāmataṇhā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "craving for sensual pleasure"@en ;
  skos:definition "Thirst for pleasant sights, sounds, smells, tastes, touches, and ideas. One of the three kinds of taṇhā."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "sensual craving"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving for sense pleasure"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#kamacchanda> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#bhavatanha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "bhavataṇhā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "craving for becoming"@en ;
  skos:definition "Thirst to continue, to be a particular kind of being, or to arrive at a particular state."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving for existence"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving to become"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#bhava> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#vibhavatanha> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-four-noble-truths> ;
  skos:prefLabel "vibhavataṇhā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "craving for non-becoming"@en ;
  skos:definition "Thirst to be rid of what is painful, or for a painful state to stop. It is still craving."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving for annihilation"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "craving to get rid of"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#tanha> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#nirodha> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#atthangikamagga> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-eightfold-path> ;
  skos:prefLabel "ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "noble eightfold path"@en ;
  skos:definition "Right view, intention, speech, action, livelihood, effort, mindfulness, and collectedness. Together they are the path truth."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "eightfold path"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "noble eightfold path"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammaditthi> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammasankappa> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammavaca> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammakammanta> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammaajiva> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammavayama> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammasati> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammasamadhi> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammaditthi> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-eightfold-path> ;
  skos:prefLabel "sammādiṭṭhi"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "right view"@en ;
  skos:definition "Seeing experience in the light of the four truths, kamma, and not-self, rather than through a fixed identity."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "right view"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#atthangikamagga> ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#panna> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammasankappa> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-eightfold-path> ;
  skos:prefLabel "sammāsaṅkappa"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "right intention"@en ;
  skos:definition "Intention of letting go, of goodwill, and of non-harming."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "right intention"@en ;
  skos:altLabel "right thought"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#atthangikamagga> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammavaca> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-eightfold-path> ;
  skos:prefLabel "sammāvācā"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "right speech"@en ;
  skos:definition "Speech that abstains from lying, harshness, division, and idle chatter."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "right speech"@en ;
  skos:related <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sila> ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> .

<https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#sammakammanta> a owl:Class, skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology> ;
  rdfs:subClassOf <https://marlonbarrios.github.io/sati-ontology#group-eightfold-path> ;
  skos:prefLabel "sammākammanta"@pi ;
  skos:prefLabel "right action"@en ;
  skos:definition "Bodily conduct that abstains from killing, taking what is not given, and sexual harm."@en ;
  skos:altLabel "right action"@en ;
